WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A stream can contain both target numbers.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The second target may be harder to report when it follows soon after the first.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
An immediate target can sometimes be spared. Timing and distractors matter.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Researchers studied three months of intensive meditation training, not a retail audio product.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A twelve-minute audio format is not evidence for an hour-equivalent result.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ask what the experiment measured. Read the original source.